{"seq":2,"slug":"actor-critic","title":"Actor-Critic 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/policy-based-methods/actor-critic","wordCount":1547,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"actor-critic-架构\">Actor-Critic 架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Actor-Critic 是一种结合了策略优化和价值估计的混合架构，通过引入 Critic（价值函数估计器）来降低 Actor（策略）梯度估计的方差。Actor 负责选择动作，Critic 负责评估动作的好坏。这种分工使得策略梯度方法既保持了直接优化策略的灵活性，又获得了基于值方法的低方差优势。</p>\n<p>Actor-Critic 的核心思想是用 Critic 提供的优势估计 A(s,a) 替代 REINFORCE 中的完整回报 G_t，在不引入偏差（或可控偏差）的前提下大幅降低梯度方差。优势函数 A^π(s,a) = Q^π(s,a) - V^π(s) 衡量的是在状态 s 选择动作 a 比&quot;平均动作&quot;好多少，天然具有零均值的性质，是方差缩减的理想选择。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Actor π_θ] --&gt;|选择动作 a| B[环境]&#10;    B --&gt;|s, r, s_next| C[Critic V_w]&#10;    C --&gt;|优势估计 A| A&#10;    C --&gt;|TD 误差 δ| D[更新 Critic]&#10;    A --&gt;|策略梯度| E[更新 Actor]&#10;    subgraph Actor-Critic 架构&#10;        A&#10;        C&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[Actor π_θ] --&gt;|选择动作 a| B[环境]\n    B --&gt;|s, r, s_next| C[Critic V_w]\n    C --&gt;|优势估计 A| A\n    C --&gt;|TD 误差 δ| D[更新 Critic]\n    A --&gt;|策略梯度| E[更新 Actor]\n    subgraph Actor-Critic 架构\n        A\n        C\n    end</pre><p>Actor-Critic 家族的演化对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变体</th>\n<th>Critic 估计</th>\n<th>优势计算</th>\n<th>偏差</th>\n<th>方差</th>\n<th>代表算法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>REINFORCE + Baseline</td>\n<td>V(s)</td>\n<td>G_t - V(s)</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>REINFORCE-b</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单步 AC</td>\n<td>V(s)</td>\n<td>δ = r + γV(s&#39;) - V(s)</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>A2C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>n 步 AC</td>\n<td>V(s)</td>\n<td>n步回报 - V(s)</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>A3C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GAE</td>\n<td>V(s)</td>\n<td>λ加权TD误差</td>\n<td>可调</td>\n<td>可调</td>\n<td>PPO</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"优势函数与-td-误差\">优势函数与 TD 误差</h2><p>优势函数 A^π(s,a) = Q^π(s,a) - V^π(s) 的核心作用是将策略梯度中的绝对值信号转化为相对值信号。使用绝对回报 G_t 作为梯度权重时，即使所有动作都获得正回报，概率更新的方向也可能受噪声主导。优势函数通过减去基线 V(s)，使得&quot;好于平均&quot;的动作获得正权重、&quot;差于平均&quot;的动作获得负权重，梯度方向更加准确。</p>\n<p>在实践中，优势函数的精确计算需要知道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mi>π</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q^\\pi(s,a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mi>π</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V^\\pi(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，两者都不直接可得。最简单的近似是使用 TD 误差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_t = r_{t+1} + \\gamma V_w(s_{t+1}) - V_w(s_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 作为优势的单步估计。数学上可以证明 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>π</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[\\delta_t \\mid s_t, a_t] = A^\\pi(s_t, a_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mi>π</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V^\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的精确估计时），因此 TD 误差是优势函数的无偏估计。</p>\n<p>然而，单步 TD 误差引入了自举偏差（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mi>π</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V^\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的精确估计）。为了在偏差和方差之间找到更好的平衡，<strong>广义优势估计（Generalized Advantage Estimation, GAE）</strong> 将多步 TD 误差进行指数加权平均：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mi>λ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>l</mi></msup><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A^{\\mathrm{GAE}(\\gamma, \\lambda)}_t = \\sum_{l=0}^{\\infty} (\\gamma\\lambda)^l\\, \\delta_{t+l}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2906em;vertical-align:-0.2458em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">GAE</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9535em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 λ∈[0,1] 控制偏差-方差权衡。λ=0 时退化为单步 TD 误差（低方差高偏差），λ=1 时等价于蒙特卡洛优势估计（高方差无偏差）。实践中 λ 通常设为 0.95-0.99，在大多数任务上效果良好。</p>\n<p>GAE 是 PPO 和 A3C 等现代算法的标准优势估计方法，也是 Actor-Critic 架构在实践中成功的关键因素之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"a2c-与-a3c\">A2C 与 A3C</h2><p><strong>A2C（Advantage Actor-Critic）</strong> 是 Actor-Critic 架构的同步实现。多个环境实例并行运行，收集固定步数的经验后统一计算梯度并更新参数。同步更新保证了所有 worker 使用相同的策略版本，梯度估计稳定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[共享参数 θ, w] --&gt; B[Worker 1]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Worker 2]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Worker N]&#10;    B --&gt; E[收集经验]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[聚合梯度]&#10;    F --&gt; G[同步更新]&#10;    G --&gt; A&#10;    subgraph A2C 同步架构&#10;        B&#10;        C&#10;        D&#10;        E&#10;        F&#10;        G&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[共享参数 θ, w] --&gt; B[Worker 1]\n    A --&gt; C[Worker 2]\n    A --&gt; D[Worker N]\n    B --&gt; E[收集经验]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[聚合梯度]\n    F --&gt; G[同步更新]\n    G --&gt; A\n    subgraph A2C 同步架构\n        B\n        C\n        D\n        E\n        F\n        G\n    end</pre><p><strong>A3C（Asynchronous Advantage Actor-Critic）</strong> 是异步版本，每个 worker 独立地与自己的环境交互并计算梯度，然后异步地更新共享参数。异步更新的优势是无需等待最慢的 worker，吞吐量更高；但不同 worker 使用的策略版本可能不一致，引入了策略延迟（Policy Lag）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>A2C</th>\n<th>A3C</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>更新方式</td>\n<td>同步</td>\n<td>异步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>梯度聚合</td>\n<td>批量平均</td>\n<td>各自更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>策略一致性</td>\n<td>完全一致</td>\n<td>可能不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>吞吐量</td>\n<td>受最慢 worker 限制</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实际效果</td>\n<td>通常更好或相当</td>\n<td>GPU 利用率可能更低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实证研究表明，在现代 GPU 硬件上 A2C 的效果通常不逊于 A3C，且实现更简单、调试更方便。因此 A2C 成为了更主流的选择，特别是在 PPO 的实现中通常采用 A2C 风格的同步并行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网络架构设计\">网络架构设计</h2><p>Actor-Critic 架构中网络结构的设计对学习效果有重要影响。核心设计决策是 Actor 和 Critic 是否共享网络参数。</p>\n<p><strong>共享网络</strong>：Actor 和 Critic 共享底层特征提取网络，只在最后一层分别输出动作概率和状态价值。优势是参数更少、特征提取更高效（特别是从图像等高维输入学习时），且两个任务可以互相提供有用的梯度信号。缺点是两个优化目标可能互相干扰——Actor 需要的特征和 Critic 需要的特征不完全相同。</p>\n<p><strong>独立网络</strong>：Actor 和 Critic 使用完全独立的网络，各自有独立的参数和优化器。优势是避免了目标冲突，各自可以学到最适合自己任务的特征表示。缺点是参数量翻倍，且失去了特征共享带来的正则化效果。</p>\n<p>实践中，图像输入通常使用共享网络（因为卷积特征提取的计算成本高），低维状态输入可以考虑独立网络。当使用共享网络时，需要仔细调节 Actor 和 Critic 损失的权重比例，以及添加熵正则化项防止策略过早收敛。</p>\n<p>总损失函数通常为：L = L_actor + c_1 · L_critic + c_2 · H(π)，其中 c_1 是 Critic 损失权重（通常 0.5），c_2 是熵正则化系数（通常 0.01），H(π) 是策略的熵，鼓励探索。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Actor-Critic))&#10;    优势估计&#10;      优势函数&#10;      TD 误差&#10;      GAE&#10;    并行架构&#10;      A2C 同步&#10;      A3C 异步&#10;      多环境并行&#10;    网络设计&#10;      共享网络&#10;      独立网络&#10;      损失权重&#10;    关键思想&#10;      Actor 选动作&#10;      Critic 评估&#10;      方差缩减\">mindmap\n  root((Actor-Critic))\n    优势估计\n      优势函数\n      TD 误差\n      GAE\n    并行架构\n      A2C 同步\n      A3C 异步\n      多环境并行\n    网络设计\n      共享网络\n      独立网络\n      损失权重\n    关键思想\n      Actor 选动作\n      Critic 评估\n      方差缩减</pre><ul>\n<li>Actor-Critic 架构结合策略优化（Actor）和价值估计（Critic），大幅降低策略梯度的方差</li>\n<li>优势函数将绝对回报信号转化为相对信号，TD 误差是其简单有效的单步近似</li>\n<li>GAE 通过 λ 参数在偏差和方差之间灵活权衡，是现代算法的标准优势估计方法</li>\n<li>A2C（同步）在现代硬件上通常不逊于 A3C（异步），且实现更简单</li>\n<li>共享网络在高维输入时高效，独立网络在低维输入时更灵活</li>\n<li>Actor-Critic 是 PPO、SAC 等现代算法的基础架构</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Actor-Critic 架构","id":"actor-critic-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"优势函数与 TD 误差","id":"优势函数与-td-误差"},{"level":2,"text":"A2C 与 A3C","id":"a2c-与-a3c"},{"level":2,"text":"网络架构设计","id":"网络架构设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"策略梯度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/policy-based-methods/policy-gradient"},"next":{"title":"PPO 与 TRPO","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/policy-based-methods/ppo-and-trpo"}}